{"code":0,"data":{"title":"APP下载页关联快应用","content":"<h1 id=\"s-sq3bx9dg\">一、功能简介</h1><p>开发者将快应用关联原生app后，可在vivo应用商店内的app下载页面，显示快应用“秒开体验”功能入口，用户点击即可拉起快应用。</p><p><br></p><h1 id=\"s-tm92n3i0\">二、关联效果</h1><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20220802/j2lk9n/20220802105312110937.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" data-natural-width=\"528\" data-natural-height=\"827\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><br></p><h1 id=\"s-9hk1c3ms\">三、关联方法</h1><p>1、在vivo后台单独上传或更新时：</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20251120/wnqw36/20251120160915363020.png\" data-natural-width=\"1701\" data-natural-height=\"636\" data-type=\"image\"><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20251120/v307ri/20251120161129020099.png\" data-natural-width=\"1703\" data-natural-height=\"847\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p>2、在快应用官网后台上传或更新时：<img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20220802/3shf2j/20220802105436641563.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" data-natural-width=\"1772\" data-natural-height=\"770\" data-type=\"image\"><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20220802/lvrtkt/20220802105457578081.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" data-natural-width=\"1772\" data-natural-height=\"830\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><br></p>","versionCode":7,"updateTime":1763626334000,"breadCrumbs":"快应用管理,开放能力,APP下载页关联快应用","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}